'''May Gauntlet''' (5月強襲！, ''5 Gatsu Kyōshū！'', '''May Assault!''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that only appears during May and was added in the [[Version 11.4 Update]]. It features enemies from the [[Love is Sickness (Monthly Event)|Love is Sickness]] event.

==Overview==
===About===
The May Gauntlet contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] stages, called '''Sickness''' (五月病 Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a Sickness Lv can include [[Battle Items]], one Platinum Fragment and [[Ototo Corps|Catamins]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[May Gauntlet/Sickness Lv.1~10]].''

==Play Requirements==
*May Gauntlet is unlocked after clearing [[Love is Sickness (Monthly Event)|Love is Sickness]].

